1
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:07,526
So, one of my favorite
video games of all time

2
00:00:07,525 --> 00:00:09,995
(Leonard:)is called Shadow
of the Colossus,
and it was only

3
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:11,295
(Leonard:)for PlayStation 2,

4
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:13,166
(Leonard:)but then they came out
with a new version

5
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:14,464
(Leonard:)for PS3 with better graphics.

6
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:16,266
(Leonard:)I finally got the chance
to play it,

7
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:19,637
(Leonard:)and for some reason, it just
wasn't as good as the first one.

8
00:00:24,142 --> 00:00:26,912
(Leonard:)Or something about yoga.

9
00:00:26,911 --> 00:00:29,851
(Penny:)I'm sorry--
I was thinking about work.

10
00:00:29,848 --> 00:00:32,278
(Leonard:)Well, I was just saying that
there was this video game...

11
00:00:32,283 --> 00:00:34,753
(Penny:)Yeah, that's when I started
thinking about work.

12
00:00:34,753 --> 00:00:37,183
(Penny:)Uh, listen, I've got
some good news.

13
00:00:37,188 --> 00:00:39,188
(Leonard:)Hmm.

14
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,860
(Penny:)This is for you.

15
00:00:40,859 --> 00:00:42,359
(Leonard:)Huh.

16
00:00:45,163 --> 00:00:46,993
(Leonard:)What is this?

17
00:00:46,998 --> 00:00:48,898
(Penny:)Well, you know how
they gave me the company car?

18
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,170
(Penny:)Didn't make sense to have two,
so I sold the other one.

19
00:00:51,169 --> 00:00:52,999
(Leonard:)The one I gave you?

20
00:00:53,004 --> 00:00:55,534
(Penny:)Yeah. And there's your money
back-- and now we're even.

21
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,810
(laughs):
How great is that?

22
00:00:57,809 --> 00:01:00,109
(Leonard:)Uh, yeah.

23
00:01:00,111 --> 00:01:01,841
(Penny:)What?

